<title>ALGERIA: Polling stations close in Algeria election.</title>
<headline>Polling stations close in Algeria election.</headline>
<dateline>ALGIERS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>All polling stations closed across Algeria on Thursday to end the first general election since the country plunged into civil strife five years ago.</p>
<p>Officials said most stations closed at 7 p.m. (1800 GMT) but voting was extended for an hour at some stations by the Interior Ministry to allow last-minute voters to cast their ballots.</p>
</text>
